 134:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_spi.c ****        the following table resume the max SPI frequency reached with data size 8bits/16bits,
 135:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_spi.c ****          according to frequency of the APBx Peripheral Clock (fPCLK) used by the SPI instance.
